'''Treaty of Tamsui''' may refer to:

* [[Treaty of Tamsui (1618)]], the agreement between the [[Sinchew Colony]] and [[Hachinawa]] that divided the [[Timara]] country and fixed the frontier of 1618
* [[Treaty of Tamsui (1656)]], the agreement between [[Hachinawa]], the [[Sinchew Colony]] and the [[Louyang Colony]] that ended the [[Sinchew War]] and partitioned the empire

